---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '~/components/Eyebrow.astro';
import GradientOrb from '~/components/GradientOrb.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Notice" description="How the Iloilo Science and Technology University and Community Multi-Purpose Cooperative collects, uses, and protects personal information submitted through this website, per RA 10173 (Data Privacy Act of 2012).">
  <section class="relative bg-navy text-white overflow-hidden">
    <GradientOrb position="top-right" size="md" intensity={0.2} />
    <div class="container-page py-16 md:py-24 relative">
      <Eyebrow color="orange">Data privacy</Eyebrow>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl md:text-5xl text-white max-w-3xl">Privacy Notice</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-page py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10 text-ink leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-brand-bg border-t-[3px] border-orange rounded-b-lg p-6">
        <p><strong class="font-display text-navy">Data Protection Officer (DPO):</strong> Elma E. Liza, Finance Head<br />
          Iloilo Science and Technology University<br />and Community Multi-Purpose Cooperative<br />
          Burgos St., La Paz, Iloilo City<br />
          CDA Reg. No. 9520-06008210</p>
      </div>

      <p>This notice complies with <strong>Republic Act No. 10173 (Data Privacy Act of 2012)</strong> and its implementing rules and regulations from the National Privacy Commission (NPC). It covers this public website, <code>isatucmpc.coop</code>. The Member Portal (MemberFolio) has its own privacy notice, shown inside the portal.</p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-navy">What this website collects</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">You can browse every page of this site without giving us any personal information. We collect personal information only when you submit one of two forms:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li><strong>Membership application form</strong>: full name, date of birth, sex, <strong>civil status</strong>, contact number, email address, employment category, membership type, associate qualification, and (for associate members) the name of your recommending member. Civil status is <strong>sensitive personal information</strong> under §3(l) of RA 10173.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact form</strong>: your name, email address, and message.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">Both forms use Cloudflare Turnstile to block automated abuse; Turnstile processes technical browser signals and is covered by Cloudflare's privacy policy.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-navy">Where your information goes</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li>Your submission is delivered <strong>as an email to the cooperative's office inbox</strong>, transmitted over encrypted connections through our email provider (Resend). You receive an acknowledgement copy at the email address you gave.</li>
          <li>The pre-filled application form (PDF) is generated <strong>inside your own browser</strong> and downloaded directly to your device — it is never uploaded to us.</li>
          <li>This website itself keeps <strong>no database of submissions</strong> and sets no advertising or analytics cookies.</li>
          <li>The map on our Contact page loads tiles from OpenStreetMap; your IP address is visible to OpenStreetMap when the map loads, as with any embedded map.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-navy">Why we collect it</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li>To process your membership application, verify your eligibility, and schedule your Pre-Membership Education Seminar (PMES) and in-person verification</li>
          <li>To respond to your enquiry and keep a record of our correspondence</li>
          <li>To protect the forms from spam and automated abuse</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-navy">How long we keep it</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li><strong>Membership application emails</strong>: until your application is decided, then as part of your membership record if you join (retained per Cooperative Development Authority recordkeeping requirements), or disposed of if you do not proceed</li>
          <li><strong>Enquiry emails</strong>: as long as needed to respond and follow up, then disposed of in periodic clean-ups</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-navy">Who can see it</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li><strong>Authorized cooperative staff</strong> who process applications and enquiries — only what their role requires</li>
          <li><strong>Government regulators</strong> (CDA, BIR, NPC) when required by law and under proper legal process</li>
          <li><strong>No one else.</strong> We do not sell, rent, or share your information with marketers or any external party.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-navy">Your rights under RA 10173</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">You have the right to:</p>
        <ol class="mt-4 list-decimal pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li><strong>Be informed</strong> about how your personal information is processed (this notice)</li>
          <li><strong>Access</strong> the information we hold about you — request a copy from the DPO</li>
          <li><strong>Correct</strong> inaccurate or outdated information</li>
          <li><strong>Erasure or blocking</strong> under the conditions set by law</li>
          <li><strong>Damages</strong> from unauthorized processing</li>
          <li><strong>Data portability</strong> — receive your information in a commonly used format</li>
          <li><strong>Object</strong> to processing</li>
          <li><strong>File a complaint</strong> with the National Privacy Commission</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-navy">How to contact the DPO</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">For any privacy-related question, request, or complaint:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li><strong>Name:</strong> Elma E. Liza, Finance Head (designated DPO)</li>
          <li><strong>Office:</strong> ISATUCMPC, Burgos St., La Paz, Iloilo City</li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +63 950 108 8310</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> isatucmpc1964@gmail.com</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">We commit to acknowledge your inquiry within <strong>5 working days</strong> and provide a substantive response within <strong>15 working days</strong>.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">If you are not satisfied with our response, you may file a complaint with:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc pl-6">
          <li><strong>National Privacy Commission (NPC)</strong> — <a href="https://www.privacy.gov.ph" class="text-navy underline underline-offset-2">https://www.privacy.gov.ph</a> — complaints@privacy.gov.ph</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate"><em>Version 2026-08. This notice is reviewed annually and republished whenever data-processing practices change.</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
